# kind: dynt-atoms
# description: A password input field: EFIELD_2 (130) with INVISIBLE set and an empty value.
# derivation: atom_length 19 (PV-0602/0603); header (PV-0140) etype 0x82=130 (PV-0606/0630), row 3 col 20 (PV-0610/0611), attr 0x42 = INVISIBLE|YES3D (PV-0612/0621/0626) so IMPL-DA-1 treats it as a password field. dlg_flag_1=4, dlg_flag_2=1 are carried verbatim (PV-0604/0605), not interpreted (SPEC-GAP #34). Payload (PV-0651): flag1 0, dlen 0, mlen 12, maxnrchars 40; no text bytes, so dlen equals the rest of the atom (atom_length-19 = 0, PV-0652). content_length = 6, text_length = 0.
